OL,3,GNEWSATwo children among four dead after
OL,4,AWaterford house fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo children are among four people who
OL,7,Fhave died after a house fire in
OL,8,FWaterford city in the Republic of
OL,9,FIreland.
OL,11,FGardai (Irish police) confirmed the
OL,12,Fdeaths of a man, a woman and the two
OL,13,Fchildren following the blaze on Birch
OL,14,FAvenue shortly after 05:00 local time
OL,15,Fon Tuesday.
OL,17,FTwo other children have been critically
OL,18,Finjured and they are being treated in
OL,19,Fhospital.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
