OL,3,GNEWSATwo children among four dead after
OL,4,AWaterford house fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FGardai said they were "investigating
OL,7,Fall the circumstances" of the fire and
OL,8,Fappealed to anyone who was in the
OL,9,Fvicinity in the early hours of Tuesday
OL,10,Fto contact them.
